caption: Consecrations, Oaths, and Gifts

A prospective priest receives the Dragon’s formal acknowledgment only after completing that Dragon’s Consecration. Each Dragon’s Oath acts as a Pact limitation on that Dragon’s Gifts. The listed Magic is taught by the Dragon rather than automatically granted as a free trait.
